// Kicker = an optional additional cost [CR#702.33a]: "you may pay an
// additional [cost] as you cast this spell" — the [CR#118.8b] shape,
// announced at [CR#601.2b], declared as the tagged
// `StaticEffect::CostOption` (`OptionalCost`). "If it was kicked" readers
// are the tag's three channels — `PaidCost(Kicker)` [CR#702.33d],
// `TimesPaid(Kicker)` [CR#702.33c] (multikicker = `repeatable: true`),
// `WasPaidWith(Kicker)` [CR#702.33e] — the [CR#607] linked-ability read.
(
    name: "Kicker",
    template: "kicker ${0}",
    kinds: [KeywordAbility],
    params: [Cost],
    body: Composite(
        name: "Kicker",
        abilities: [Static(effects: [
            CostOption(components: Param(0), tag: Kicker),
        ])],
    ),
)
